{"id": "dba515ca-2c40-41de-8c23-e8789ff3d22c", "slug": "prism-dynamics", "title": "Prism Dynamics", "description": "Prism Dynamics UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Prism Dynamics\"\ndescription: \"Prism Dynamics UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF0000\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FF7F00\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Prism Dynamics\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 2; favorites: 0; remixes: 2.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, threejs, effect.\n## Overview\nPrism Dynamics UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nPrism Dynamics SYS.REV // 2044 V-120 OMEGA Status Calibrating Modulating Frequencies For Optimal Output.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Prism Dynamics; V-120 OMEGA.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF0000, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FF7F00, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Prism Dynamics</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP & ScrollTrigger -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-black text-white overflow-x-hidden antialiased font-sans relative\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-90\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines & Corner Squares -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-between px-4 md:px-12 lg:px-24\" style=\"opacity: 0.15;\">\n        <!-- Left Line -->\n        <div class=\"h-full bg-white relative\" style=\"width: 1px;\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-12 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white bg-black\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-12 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white bg-black\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Center Line -->\n        <div class=\"h-full bg-white relative hidden md:block\" style=\"width: 1px;\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-12 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white bg-black\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-12 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white bg-black\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Right Line -->\n        <div class=\"h-full bg-white relative\" style=\"width: 1px;\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-12 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white bg-black\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-12 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white bg-black\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-16 lg:p-32\">\n\n            <!-- Header/Logo -->\n            <div class=\"max-w-2xl glitch-container\" style=\"position: relative;\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-4\" style=\"line-height: 0.85;\">\n                    Prism<br>\n                    <span class=\"ml-8 md:ml-16 block\">Dynamics</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rainbow-linear\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-white mt-1\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </h1>\n                <!-- Glitch layers generated via JS -->\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer Details -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end w-full gap-8 mt-24 md:mt-0\">\n\n                <!-- Format Specs -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500 font-medium\">SYS.REV // 2044</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase flex items-center gap-3\">\n                        V-120\n                        <span class=\"text-xs md:text-sm border border-zinc-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm text-zinc-300 font-medium\">OMEGA</span>\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Border Gradient Element -->\n                <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)); padding: 1px;\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-black backdrop-blur-xl px-5 py-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-4 h-full w-full transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-zinc-900/90\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 font-medium\">Status</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-white uppercase\">Calibrating</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-red-500 rounded-full\" style=\"animation: pulse-fast 1s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Scroll Reveal Section -->\n        <section class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-6 md:p-16 relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <!-- Decorative background glow -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-full max-w-2xl aspect-square rounded-full opacity-20 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen blur-3xl\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168,85,247,0.4) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"max-w-4xl text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-2 md:gap-4 relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\">\n                    <span class=\"reveal-word block text-2xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase text-zinc-400\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">Modulating</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\">\n                    <span class=\"reveal-word block text-3xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase text-transparent bg-clip-text\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff0000, #ff7f00, #ffff00, #00ff00, #0000ff, #4b0082, #8b00ff); transform: translateY(110%);\">Frequencies</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block align-top\">\n                    <span class=\"reveal-word block text-2xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase text-zinc-400\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">For Optimal Output.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Ribbon Animation (Three.js) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 20;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Custom Shader Material for the Rainbow Ribbon\n            const vertexShader = `\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n                varying float vElevation;\n                uniform float uTime;\n\n                void main() {\n                    vUv = uv;\n\n                    vec3 pos = position;\n\n                    // Complex sine wave distortion to create a twisting folding effect\n                    float twist = sin(pos.y * 0.2 + uTime * 0.5) * 2.0;\n                    float fold = cos(pos.x * 0.5 - uTime * 0.8) * 3.0;\n\n                    pos.z += sin(pos.x * 0.5 + uTime) * 1.5;\n                    pos.z += cos(pos.y * 0.3 - uTime) * 1.5;\n                    pos.x += twist * sin(pos.y * 0.1);\n                    pos.y += fold * cos(pos.x * 0.1);\n\n                    vElevation = pos.z;\n\n                    gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(pos, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const fragmentShader = `\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n                varying float vElevation;\n\n                void main() {\n                    // Define strict color bands for retro rainbow\n                    vec3 color = vec3(0.0);\n                    float bands = 7.0;\n                    float bandIndex = floor(vUv.x * bands);\n\n                    if (bandIndex == 0.0) color = vec3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0);      // Red\n                    else if (bandIndex == 1.0) color = vec3(1.0, 0.4, 0.0); // Orange\n                    else if (bandIndex == 2.0) color = vec3(1.0, 1.0, 0.0); // Yellow\n                    else if (bandIndex == 3.0) color = vec3(0.0, 1.0, 0.0); // Green\n                    else if (bandIndex == 4.0) color = vec3(0.0, 1.0, 1.0); // Cyan\n                    else if (bandIndex == 5.0) color = vec3(0.0, 0.0, 1.0); // Blue\n                    else color = vec3(0.6, 0.0, 1.0);                       // Purple\n\n                    // Add subtle shading based on depth\n                    float shade = (vElevation + 2.0) * 0.2;\n                    color *= clamp(shade, 0.4, 1.0);\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(8, 30, 64, 128);\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                vertexShader,\n                fragmentShader,\n                uniforms: {\n                    uTime: { value: 0 }\n                },\n                side: THREE.DoubleSide,\n                wireframe: false\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            // Position and rotate to match the reference poster's diagonal flow\n            mesh.rotation.z = Math.PI * -0.2;\n            mesh.rotation.x = Math.PI * 0.1;\n            mesh.position.x = 2;\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n                material.uniforms.uTime.value = elapsedTime;\n\n                // Subtle camera drift\n                camera.position.x = Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.2) * 0.5;\n                camera.position.y = Math.cos(elapsedTime * 0.2) * 0.5;\n                camera.lookAt(scene.position);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Masked Staggered Word Reveal\n            gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".reveal-word\",\n                    start: \"top 80%\",\n                    toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                }\n            });\n        };\n\n        // --- Retro Glitch Effect ---\n        const initGlitch = () => {\n            const container = document.querySelector('.glitch-container');\n            const h1 = container.querySelector('h1');\n\n            // Clone h1 for glitch layers\n            const layer1 = h1.cloneNode(true);\n            const layer2 = h1.cloneNode(true);\n\n            // Style layers inline\n            const baseStyle = \"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; mix-blend-mode: screen;\";\n            layer1.style.cssText = baseStyle + \"color: cyan; transform: translateX(-2px); z-index: -1;\";\n            layer2.style.cssText = baseStyle + \"color: red; transform: translateX(2px); z-index: -2;\";\n\n            container.appendChild(layer1);\n            container.appendChild(layer2);\n\n            setInterval(() => {\n                if (Math.random() > 0.95) { // 5% chance to glitch every interval\n                    layer1.style.opacity = '0.7';\n                    layer2.style.opacity = '0.7';\n\n                    // Random shifts\n                    layer1.style.transform = `translate(${Math.random() * 6 - 3}px, ${Math.random() * 4 - 2}px)`;\n                    layer2.style.transform = `translate(${Math.random() * -6 + 3}px, ${Math.random() * -4 + 2}px)`;\n\n                    // Quick reset\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        layer1.style.opacity = '0';\n                        layer2.style.opacity = '0';\n                        layer1.style.transform = 'translateX(-2px)';\n                        layer2.style.transform = 'translateX(2px)';\n                    }, 50 + Math.random() * 100);\n                }\n            }, 100);\n        };\n\n        // Add CSS keyframes dynamically for pulse (since no style tag allowed)\n        const addInlineKeyframes = () => {\n             const styleSheet = document.createElement(\"style\");\n             styleSheet.innerText = `\n                @keyframes pulse-fast {\n                    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }\n                    50% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scale(0.8); }\n                }\n             `;\n             document.head.appendChild(styleSheet);\n        }\n\n        // Initialize all\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            addInlineKeyframes();\n            initWebGL();\n            initGSAP();\n            initGlitch();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "prism-dynamics.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/prism-dynamics.jpg", "source_name": "prism-dynamics-DESIGN.md", "views": 53, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T06:03:00.589634+00:00"}